<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back further 925,400 shares.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back further 925,400 shares.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said it bought back a further 925,400 more shares between NZ$6.51 and $6.63 on Monday in its continuing NZ$1 billion buyback programme.</p>
<p>The shares closed 18 cents lower at $6.51 after shedding a 9.5 cent dividend.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
